<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">I'm sorry to hear that you were denied admission to ASU. You can appeal your admission decision if you feel ASU will provide you with the best opportunity to be academically successful.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>To appeal your admission decision, please submit:</b></font></div><div><ul><li><span style="font-family: arial;">a letter explaining your academic record and your plan to be successful at ASU</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">three supporting letters of recommendation from faculty</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">additional materials, such as improved ACT or SAT test scores, that may meet admission requirements*&nbsp;</span></li></ul></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">*New test scores must be sent directly from the testing agency. Please indicate in your appeal letter that you are submitting new scores for the committee to review.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Send your appeal letter and recommendations electronically to <a href="mailto:AdmissionAppeals@asu.edu">AdmissionAppeals@asu.edu</a>.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">There is no set time frame on an appeal decision as students are reviewed on a case-by-case basis. The admission appeal board meets regularly to review completed files for appeal.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">For many people, community college is a great pathway to ASU. Many students demonstrate academic success by starting at the community college level and then <a href="https://transfer.asu.edu/">transferring to ASU</a>.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Please let me know if you have any additional questions about the admission process.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>